OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FRainbands moving southeast across the
OL,7,FUK on Monday, followed by sunshine and
OL,8,Fshowers on Tuesday. Rain heaviest in
OL,9,Fthe north, where gales possible.
OL,10,FGenerally drier, brighter with lighter
OL,11,Fwinds midweek.
